MessageIdTypedef=DWORD
LanguageNames=(English=0x409:MSG00409)

MessageId=1000
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_OBSERVED
Language=English
BDG observed a file I/O request. Observation does not block access or establish whether the operation succeeded.
%1
.

MessageId=1001
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_DENIED
Language=English
BDG denied a file open under its active policy.
%1
.

MessageId=1002
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_ALLOWED
Language=English
BDG policy allowed a file open. Filesystem permissions can still deny access.
%1
.

MessageId=1003
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_AUDIT_LOSS
Language=English
BDG reports missing audit events or discarded correlation data.
%1
.

MessageId=1004
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_STATUS
Language=English
BDG collector status changed.
%1
.

MessageId=1005
SymbolicName=BDG_EVENT_ERROR
Language=English
BDG collector stopped because of an error.
%1
.
